    "front": "How should a J411 explanation answer develop a cause?",
    "back": "Model answer: Explain how a reason led to the outcome, supported by precise evidence. Marking points: Accurate knowledge; causal link; developed explanation. Common trap: Naming causes without explaining their effects.",
