    "front": "How should a J411 18-mark judgement answer reach the highest levels?",
    "back": "Model answer: Explain evidence on both sides and reach a supported judgement. Marking points: Strong knowledge; developed reasoning; balanced argument; clear judgement. Common trap: One-sided assertions or a list of facts.",
